This directory contains a customized derivative of howler.js.

It is NOT the upstream library. The code has been renamed to melonJS
conventions, restructured (the plugin registry removed and spatial audio merged
in), corrected against defects present in the version it was taken from, and
extended. See CHANGELOG.md in this directory for the full list of changes.

The original work is used under the MIT license, reproduced in full below. That
license covers the original code; the modifications are part of melonJS and are
distributed under melonJS's own license.

